('6f7fe7b9-9300-5fc0-994d-9aa2945bb780'::uuid,'est','"Triangles, Trigonometry & Similarity"'::jsonb,'medium','mcq','"In the figure below, the measure of ∠XAB is 150°; the measure of ∠YCB is 81°; and X, A, C, and Y are collinear. What is the measure of ∠B ?\n[Figure: triangle ABC with base AC on horizontal line XY (X left, Y right); B above; exterior angle at A is 150° and exterior angle at C is 81°.]"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"F","text":"30°"},{"key":"G","text":"51°"},{"key":"H","text":"60°"},{"key":"J","text":"69°"},{"key":"K","text":"77°"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"book_t5.md","source_sha256":"fb0beb8b38f3ff520bee0bf84d567ee65d0b5e7154f4a58335fa388c652dd787","source_question_id":"T5-24","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Triangles, Trigonometry & Similarity"}'::jsonb,'"G"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from book_t5.md (T5-24)."'::jsonb),
