('9b4a5d91-6dfc-51cb-84c7-dfa1e0fc944d'::uuid,'est','"Rational, Radical, Exponential & Logarithmic Functions"'::jsonb,'medium','mcq','"For nonzero real numbers a, b, and c, the expression (a⁵b³c⁴)/(5a²b⁷c) is equivalent to:"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"A","text":"a³c³/(5b⁴)"},{"key":"B","text":"a³c⁴/(5b⁴)"},{"key":"C","text":"a³bc⁴/(5ab⁴c)"},{"key":"D","text":"(abc)¹²/(5abc)⁹"},{"key":"E","text":"5a⁷b¹⁰c⁵"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"book_t5.md","source_sha256":"fb0beb8b38f3ff520bee0bf84d567ee65d0b5e7154f4a58335fa388c652dd787","source_question_id":"T5-30","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Rational, Radical, Exponential & Logarithmic Functions"}'::jsonb,'"A"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from book_t5.md (T5-30)."'::jsonb),
