('a35906c9-000d-5c03-9e20-eaeecaf32c57'::uuid,'est','"Coordinate Geometry, Circles & Conics"'::jsonb,'medium','mcq','"The shaded region in the standard (x,y) coordinate plane below is bounded by a parabola and a line. The shaded region and its boundary is the solution set of which of the following systems of inequalities?\n[Figure: upward parabola y = x² − 2x − 3 (vertex near (1, −4)) and descending line y = −2x + 3; the shaded region is between them, below the line and above the parabola.]"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"F","text":"y ≥ −2x + 3 ; y ≤ x² − 2x − 3"},{"key":"G","text":"y ≤ −2x + 3 ; y ≥ x² − 2x − 3"},{"key":"H","text":"y ≤ −2x + 3 ; y ≤ x² − 2x − 3"},{"key":"J","text":"y ≥ −2x − 3 ; y ≤ x² − 2x + 3"},{"key":"K","text":"y ≤ −2x − 3 ; y ≥ x² − 2x + 3"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"book_t5.md","source_sha256":"fb0beb8b38f3ff520bee0bf84d567ee65d0b5e7154f4a58335fa388c652dd787","source_question_id":"T5-38","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Coordinate Geometry, Circles & Conics"}'::jsonb,'"G"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from book_t5.md (T5-38)."'::jsonb),
